#. Tag: keyword
#: index.docbook:23
#, no-c-format
msgid "cookie"
msgstr "kolačić"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:31
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Cookies are a mechanism used by web sites to store and retrieve information "
"using your browser. For example, a web site may allow you to customize the "
"content and layout of the pages you see, so that your choices are persistent "
"across different visits to that web site."
msgstr ""
"Kolačići su mehanizam koji koriste veb stranice da čuvaju i primaju "
"informacije koristeći vaš pretraživač. Na primjer, veb stranica Vam može "
"dozvoliti da prilagodite sadržaj i izgled stranica koje posjećujete, tako da "
"izbori koje napravite budu jednaki na različitim posjetama toj stranici."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:36
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The web site is able to remember your preferences by storing a cookie on "
"your computer. Then, on future visits, the web site retrieves the "
"information stored in the cookie to format the content of the site according "
"to your previously specified preferences."
msgstr ""
"Ova veb stranica može zapamtiti vaše postavke čuvajući kolačiće na vašem "
"kompjuteru. Onda, pri budućim posjetama, veb stranica prima informacije "
"podijeljene u kolačiću da formatira kontekst stranice prema vašim prethodnim "
"postavkama."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:41
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Thus, cookies play a very useful role in web browsing. Unfortunately, web "
"sites often store and retrieve information in cookies without your explicit "
"knowledge or consent. Some of this information may be quite useful to the "
"web site owners, for example, by allowing them to collect summary statistics "
"on the number of visits different areas of the web sites get, or to "
"customize banner advertising."
msgstr ""
"Tako, kolačići igraju veoma korisnu ulogu u veb pretraživanju. Nažalost, veb "
"stranice često skladište i šalju informacije u kolačiće bez vaš eksplicitne "
"saglasnosti. Neke informacije mogu biti prilično korisne za vlasnike veb "
"stranice, tako što im dozvoljavaju da sakupljaju statističke informacije o "
"broju posjeta koje dobiju različiti dijelovi veb stranice, ili da promijene "
"reklamiranje banerima."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:48
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The cookies page allows you to set policies for the use of cookies when you "
"are browsing the web with the &konqueror; web browser."
msgstr ""
"Ova stranica kolačića Vam omogućava da podesite pravila korištenja kolačića "
"kada pretražujete veb sa &konquere; veb pretraživačem."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:52
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Note that the policies that you set using this control module will "
"<emphasis>not</emphasis> apply to other web browsers such as &Netscape;."
msgstr ""
"Imajte u vidu da se pravila koja postavite koristeći ovaj modul  "
"<emphasis>neće</emphasis> odnositi na veb pretraživače kao što su &Netscape;."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:58
#, no-c-format
msgid "Policy"
msgstr "Pravila"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:60
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Using the <guilabel>Policy</guilabel> tab, you can configure the &kde; "
"applications that will handle cookies. You can do this by specifying a "
"general cookie policy as well as special cookie policies for certain domains "
"or hosts."
msgstr ""
"Koristeći tab <guilabel>Pravila</guilabel>, možete podesiti &kde; aplikacije "
"koje koriste kolačiće. Ovo možete uraditi specificirajući opšta pravila "
"kolačića kao i specijalna pravila za određene domene ili host-ove."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:65
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The top of the policy tab has a check box labeled <guilabel>Enable cookies</"
"guilabel>. If you leave this unchecked, cookies will be completely disabled. "
"However, this may make browsing rather inconvenient, especially as some web "
"sites require the use of browsers with cookies enabled."
msgstr ""
"Vrh taba pravila ima check box nazvan <guilabel>Dozvoli kolačiće</guilabel>. "
"Ako ostavite ovo odznačeno, kolačići će biti potpuno onesposobljeni. Ipak, "
"ovo može učiniti pretraživanje krajnje neugodnim, posebno zato što neke veb "
"stranice zahtijevaju korištenje pretraživača sa uključenim kolačićima."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:71
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You will probably want to enable cookies and then set specific policies on "
"how you want them to be handled."
msgstr ""
"Vjerovatno ćete željeti dozvoliti kolačiće i onda postaviti skup posebnih "
"pravila o tome kako želite da oni budu korišteni."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:74
#, no-c-format
msgid "The first group of options create settings that apply to all cookies."
msgstr ""
"Ova prva grupa opcija čini postavke koje će se odnositi na sve kolačiće."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:78
#, no-c-format
msgid "Only accept cookies from originating server"
msgstr "Prihvatite samo kolačiće sa servera."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:80
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Some pages try to set cookies from servers other than the one you are seeing "
"the &HTML; page from. For example, they show you advertisements, and the "
"advertisements are from another computer, often one that belongs to a large "
"advertising group. These advertisements may try to set a cookie which would "
"allow them to track the pages you view across multiple web sites."
msgstr ""
"Neke stranice pokušavaju da postave kolačiće sa servera različitih od onih "
"sa kojih pregledate &HTML; stranicu. Na primjer, oni Vam prikazuju reklame, "
"i reklame sa drugog kompjutera, često nekog koji pripada velikoj grupi za "
"reklamiranje. Reklameri mogu pokušati da postave kolačiće koji će im "
"omogućiti da prate stranice koje posjećujete među višestrukim veb stranicama."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:86
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Enabling this option will mean only cookies that come from the same web "
"server as you are explicitly connecting to will be accepted."
msgstr ""
"Omogućavajući ovu opciju samo kolačići sa veb servera na koje se eksplicitno "
"priključite će biti prihvaćeni."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:92
#, no-c-format
msgid "Automatically accept session cookies"
msgstr "Automatski prihvati kolačiće sesije."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:95
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"An increasingly common use for cookies is not to track your movements across "
"many visits to a web site, but to just follow what you do during one single "
"visit. Session cookies are saved as long as you are looking at the site, and "
"deleted when you leave it."
msgstr ""
"Upotreba kolačića koja je u velikom porastu nije praćenje vašeg kretanja "
"kroz mnogo veb stranica koje posjetite, nego praćenje vaših radnji tokom "
"jedne posjete. Kolačići sesije se čuvaju dok pretražujete stranicu, i budu "
"obrisani nakon što je napustite."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:100
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Web sites can use this information for various things, most commonly it is a "
"convenience so that you do not have to keep logging in to view pages. For "
"example, on a webmail site, without some kind of session <acronym>ID</"
"acronym>, you would have to give your password again for each email you want "
"to read. There are other ways to achieve this, but cookies are simple and "
"very common."
msgstr ""
"Veb stranice mogu ove informacije koristiti za različite stvari,  najčešće "
"korištena jeste ugodnost tako da ne morate da se konstantno prijavljujete da "
"biste vidjeli stranice. Na primjer, na veb-pošti, da ne postoji neka vrsta "
"sesije <acronym>ID</acronym>, morali biste da ukucavate vašu šifru za svaku "
"poruku koju želite da pročitate. Postoje i drugi načini da se ovo postigne, "
"ali su kolačići jednostavni i veoma rasprostranjeni."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:107
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Enabling this option means that session cookies are always accepted, even if "
"you don't accept any other kind, and even if you choose to reject cookies "
"from a particular site, session cookies from that site will be accepted."
msgstr ""
"Dozvoljavajući ovu opciju znači da su kolačići sesije uvijek prihvaćeni, čak "
"i ako ne prihvaćate kolačiće bilo koje druge vrste, i čak i ako odaberete da "
"odbacite kolačiće sa određene stranice, kolačići sesije sa te stranice će "
"biti prihvaćeni."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:115
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The section for <guilabel>Default Policy</guilabel> sets some further "
"options that are mutually exclusive &mdash; you can choose only one of these "
"options as the default, but you are free to set a different option for any "
"specific web server."
msgstr ""
"Odjeljak sa <guilabel>Zadana Pravila</guilabel> postavlja neke daljnje "
"opcije koje su međusobno isključive &mdash; možete odabrati samo jednu od "
"ovih opcija kao zadanu, ali ste u mogućnosti da postavite drugačije opcije "
"za bilo koji određeni veb server."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:119
#, no-c-format
msgid "Site specific policies always take precedence over the default policy."
msgstr ""
"Pravila za određenu stranicu uvijek imaju prednost u odnosu na zadana "
"pravila."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:124
#, no-c-format
msgid "Accept all cookies"
msgstr "Prihvati sve kolačiće"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:126
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If this option is selected, all cookies will be accepted without asking for "
"confirmation."
msgstr ""
"Ako je odabrana ova opcija, svi kolačići će biti prihvaćeni bez pitanja za "
"davanje dozvole."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:131
#, no-c-format
msgid "Accept until end of session"
msgstr "Prihvati do kraja sesije"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:133
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Cookies will be accepted, but they will expire at the end of the session."
msgstr "Kolačići će biti prihvaćeni, ali će nestati po završetku sesije."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:138
#, no-c-format
msgid "Ask for confirmation"
msgstr "Traži potvrdu"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:140
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If this option is selected, you will be asked for confirmation every time a "
"cookie is stored or retrieved. You can selectively accept or reject each "
"cookie. The confirmation dialog will also allow you to set a domain specific "
"policy, if you do not want to confirm each cookie for that domain."
msgstr ""
"Ako je odabrana ova opcija, bit ćete pitani za dozvolu svaki put kada je "
"kolačić sačuvan ili primljen. Možete selektivno prihvatiti ili odbiti svaki "
"kolačić. Okvir za potvrdu će Vam također omogućiti da podesite specifična "
"pravila za domenu, ako ne želite da prihvatate svaki kolačić za tu domenu "
"pojedinačno."

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:148
#, no-c-format
msgid "Reject all cookies"
msgstr "Odbij sve kolačiće"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:150
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If this option is selected, all cookies will be rejected without asking for "
"confirmation."
msgstr ""
"Ako je odabrana ova opcija, svi kolačići će biti odbijeni bez traženja Vaše "
"potvrde."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:156
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In addition to the default policy for handling of cookies, which you can set "
"by selecting one of the three options described above, you can also set "
"policies for specific host domains using the controls in the <guilabel>Site "
"Policy</guilabel> group."
msgstr ""
"U dodatku za zadana pravila za rukovanje kolačićima, koja možete podesiti "
"birajući jednu od gore objašnjenih opcija, također možete podesiti pravila "
"za određene host domene koristeći kontrole u grupi <guilabel>Pravila "
"stranice</guilabel>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:161
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The Ask, Accept, Accept until end of session, or Reject policy can be "
"applied to a specific domain by clicking on the <guibutton>New...</"
"guibutton> button, which brings up a dialog. In this dialog, you can type "
"the name of the domain (with a leading dot), then select the policy you want "
"to apply to this domain. Note that entries may also get added while you are "
"browsing, if the default policy is to ask for confirmation, and you choose a "
"general policy for a specific host (for example, by selecting "
"<guilabel>Reject</guilabel> when asked to confirm a cookie)."
msgstr ""
"Pitaj, Prihvati, Prihvati do kraja sesije, ili Odbij pravila mogu biti "
"primijenjena na određenu domenu klikom na <guibutton>Novo...</guibutton> "
"dugme, koje otvara okvir. U ovom okviru, možete ukucati ime domene (sa "
"vodećom tačkom), zatim odabrati pravila koja želite da budu primijenjena na "
"tu domenu. Imajte u vidu da ulazi također mogu biti dodani dok pretražujete, "
"ako je zadano pravila da se traživa potvrda, i možete odabrati opšta pravila "
"za određene host-ove (na primjer, birajući <guilabel>Odbij</guilabel> kada "
"Vam se traži potvrda za kolačić)."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:171
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can also select a specific host domain from the list and click the "
"<guibutton>Change</guibutton> button to choose a different policy for that "
"domain than the one shown in the list."
msgstr ""
"Možete također odabrati domaću domenu sa liste i kliknuti na dugme "
"<guibutton>promijeni</guibutton> da odaberete drugačija pravila za tu domenu "
"od onih koja su prikazana na listi."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:175
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To delete a domain specific policy, choose a domain from the list, and then "
"click the <guibutton>Delete</guibutton> button. The default policy will "
"apply to domains which have been deleted from the list."
msgstr ""
"Da biste obrisali pravila za određenu domenu, odaberite domenu sa liste, i "
"onda kliknite dugme <guibutton>Obrisi</guibutton>. Zdana pravila će biti "
"primijenjena na domene obrisane iz liste."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:182
#, no-c-format
msgid "Management"
msgstr "Upravljanje"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:184
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In the <guilabel>Management</guilabel> tab you can browse and selectively "
"delete cookies that have been set in the past."
msgstr ""
"U tabu <guilabel>Upravljanje</guilabel> možete pretraživati i selektivno "
"brisati kolačiće koji su postavljeni u prošlosti."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:187
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In the upper part of this dialog, you can see a list of domains displayed as "
"a tree. Click on the little <guiicon>&gt;</guiicon> next to a domain to see "
"all cookies that have been set for this particular target domain. If you "
"select one of these cookies, you will notice that its contents will show up "
"in the frame <guilabel>Details</guilabel> below."
msgstr ""
"U gornjem dijelu ovog okvira, možete vidjetli listu domena prikazanu kao "
"stablo. Kliknite na malo  <guiicon>&gt;</guiicon> pored domene da biste "
"vidjeli sve kolačiće koji su postavljeni za određenu ciljanu domenu. Ako "
"odaberete ove kolačiće, primijetit ćete da će njihov sadržaj biti prikazan u "
"okviru <guilabel>Detalji</guilabel> ispod."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:193
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"By clicking the <guibutton>Delete</guibutton> button you can now delete the "
"selected cookie. Click <guibutton>Delete All</guibutton> to delete all "
"cookies stored."
msgstr ""
"Klikom na dugme <guibutton>Obriši</guibutton> možete uvijek obrisati "
"odabrani kolačić. Kliknite na dugme <guibutton>Obriši sve</guibutton> da "
"biste obrisali sve pohranjene kolačiće."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:196
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If a domain is selected, you can use <guibutton>Configure Policy</guibutton> "
"to set a site policy."
msgstr ""
"Ako je odabrana domena, možete koristiti <guibutton>Konfiguriši pravila</"
"guibutton>  da biste postavili pravila za stranicu."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:199
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Choose <guibutton>Reload List</guibutton> to reload the list from your hard "
"disk. You might want to do this if you have had the module open and are "
"testing web sites, or have made many changes in the module itself."
msgstr ""
"Odaberite  <guibutton>Osvjeći listu</guibutton> da biste osvježili listu sa "
"hard diska. Možda ćete htjeti ovo uraditi ako imate otvoren modul i "
"testirate veb stranice, ili ako ste napravili mnogo izmjena na samom modulu."
